  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1602.41 Storage",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1602.41 “Storage” means the consolidation of more than 30,000 gallons of septage for later removal to a permitted site, permitted septage facility, or wastewater treatment plant.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1600) #13944, eff 4-27-24",
